            "description": {
              "content": "This endpoint provides the necessary details a customer needs in order to configure their GCP project so that Gremlin can access it.\n\nRequires the privilege [`MINIMUM_TEAM_PRIVILEGES`](https://www.gremlin.com/docs/user-management/access-control/#privileges)",
